son strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for dance. We first advertised Saturday, but the session has moved to Wednesday. The fee is 12 pounds, including materials. Please bring your water.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-9.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-10","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Sunday","No day is confirmed","Wednesday"],"answer":"Sunday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Sunday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for theatre. We first advertised Wednesday, but the session has moved to Sunday. The fee is 24 pounds, including materials. Please bring your ticket.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-10.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-11","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["No day is confirmed","Friday","Monday"],"answer":"Monday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Monday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for sewing. We first advertised Friday, but the session has moved to Monday. The fee is 19 pounds, including materials. Please bring your fabric.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-11.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-12","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Sunday","Thursday","No day is confirmed"],"answer":"Thursday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Thursday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for astronomy. We first advertised Sunday, but the session has moved to Thursday. The fee is 38 pounds, including materials. Please bring your jacket.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-12.mp3","stage":"independent"},