 with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for rowing. We first advertised Tuesday, but the session has moved to Sunday. The fee is 41 pounds, including materials. Please bring your towel.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-16.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-17","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["No day is confirmed","Wednesday","Thursday"],"answer":"Thursday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Thursday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for chess. We first advertised Wednesday, but the session has moved to Thursday. The fee is 15 pounds, including materials. Please bring your clock.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-17.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-18","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Friday","Wednesday","No day is confirmed"],"answer":"Wednesday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Wednesday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for printing. We first advertised Friday, but the session has moved to Wednesday. The fee is 27 pounds, including materials. Please bring your paper.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-18.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-19","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Monday","No day is confirmed","Sunday"],"answer":"Monday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Monday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for film. We first advertised Sunday, but the session has moved to Monday. The fee is 36 pounds, including materials. Please bring your headphones.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-19.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-20","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["No day is confirmed","Thursday","Saturday"],"answer":"Saturday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Saturday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for geology. We first advertised Thursday, but the session has moved to Saturday. The fee is 23 pounds, including materials. Please bring your bag.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-20.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-21","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Monday","Tuesday","No day is confirmed"],"answer":"Tuesday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Tuesday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for poetry. We first advertised Monday, but the session has moved to Tuesday. The fee is 29 pounds, including materials. Please bring your book.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-21.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-22","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["Thursday","No day is confirmed","Saturday"],"answer":"Thursday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Thursday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for weaving. We first advertised Saturday, but the session has moved to Thursday. The fee is 31 pounds, including materials. Please bring your thread.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-22.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_distractors-23","kind":"choice","prompt":"On which day will the session take place?","options":["No day is confirmed","Wednesday","Friday"],"answer":"Friday","explanation":"The earlier day is corrected: the final arrangement is Friday.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"Here are the details for design. We first advertised Wednesday, but the session has moved to Friday. The fee is 25 pounds, including materials. Please bring your ruler.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_distractors-23.mp3","stage":"independent"}]}'::jsonb,true) on conflict(skill,version) do nothing;
insert into skill_lab_private.lessons(skill,module,version,content,published) values ('listening_answer_limits','listening',1,'{"skill":"listening_answer_limits","module":"listening","title":"Accurate short answers","outcome":"Record the requested detail within the word limit.","trap":"An extra word or wrong number can invalidate an answer.","strategy":"Read the instruction. Identify the answer type. Check spelling and the final number.","example":"Write ONE NUMBER: The charge is twenty pounds → 20.","version":1,"basic":true,"estimated_minutes":8,"open_prompt":null,"items":[{"id":"listening_answer_limits-0","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"14","explanation":"The final fee is 14 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for pottery. We first advertised Tuesday, but the session has moved to Thursday. The fee is 14 pounds, including materials. Please bring your studio.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-0.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-1","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"26","explanation":"The final fee is 26 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for photography. We first advertised Monday, but the session has moved to Friday. The fee is 26 pounds, including materials. Please bring your camera.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-1.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-2","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"18","explanation":"The final fee is 18 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for gardening. We first advertised Saturday, but the session has moved to Sunday. The fee is 18 pounds, including materials. Please bring your gloves.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-2.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-3","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"32","explanation":"The final fee is 32 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for history. We first advertised Wednesday, but the session has moved to Monday. The fee is 32 pounds, including materials. Please bring your notebook.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-3.mp3","stage":"guided"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-4","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"21","explanation":"The final fee is 21 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for cooking. We first advertised Friday, but the session has moved to Tuesday. The fee is 21 pounds, including materials. Please bring your apron.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-4.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-5","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"45","explanation":"The final fee is 45 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for cycling. We first advertised Sunday, but the session has moved to Saturday. The fee is 45 pounds, including materials. Please bring your helmet.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-5.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-6","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"16","explanation":"The final fee is 16 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcri