l-lab/listening_answer_limits-17.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-18","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"27","explanation":"The final fee is 27 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for printing. We first advertised Friday, but the session has moved to Wednesday. The fee is 27 pounds, including materials. Please bring your paper.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-18.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-19","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"36","explanation":"The final fee is 36 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for film. We first advertised Sunday, but the session has moved to Monday. The fee is 36 pounds, including materials. Please bring your headphones.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-19.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-20","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"23","explanation":"The final fee is 23 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for geology. We first advertised Thursday, but the session has moved to Saturday. The fee is 23 pounds, including materials. Please bring your bag.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_answer_limits-20.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_answer_limits-21","kind":"short","prompt":"What is the fee in pounds? Write ONE NUMBER.","answer":"29","explanation":"The final fee is 29 pounds. The instruction asks for a number only.","hint":"Listen for the fee, not the day or the equipment.","transcript":"Here are the details for poetry. We first advertised Monday, but the session