rs during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-12.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-13","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the writing session, you do not need to buy a laptop. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-13.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-14","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the yoga session, you do not need to buy a mat. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-14.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-15","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the walking session, you do not need to buy a boots. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-15.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-16","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the rowing session, you do not need to buy a towel. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-16.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-17","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the chess session, you do not need to buy a clock. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-17.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-18","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the printing session, you do not need to buy a paper. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-18.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-19","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the film session, you do not need to buy a headphones. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-19.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-20","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the geology session, you do not need to buy a bag. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-20.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-21","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the poetry session, you do not need to buy a book. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-21.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-22","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment must be purchased","Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the weaving session, you do not need to buy a thread. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-22.mp3","stage":"independent"},{"id":"listening_paraphrase-23","kind":"choice","prompt":"What does the speaker say about equipment?","options":["Equipment cannot be used","Equipment can be borrowed","Equipment must be purchased"],"answer":"Equipment can be borrowed","explanation":"Use and give back describes borrowing, not purchasing.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","transcript":"For the design session, you do not need to buy a ruler. You can use one of ours during the session and give it back afterwards.","audio":"/audio/skill-lab/listening_paraphrase-23.mp3","stage":"independent"}]}'::jsonb,true) on conflict(skill,version) do nothing;
insert into skill_lab_private.lessons(skill,module,version,content,published) values ('writing_paragraph_support','writing',1,'{"skill":"writing_paragraph_support","module":"writing","title":"Develop a supported paragraph","outcome":"Connect a claim to a reason and a concrete example.","trap":"Repeating a claim does not explain it.","strategy":"State the idea, explain why it matters, and demonstrate the same reason with an example.","example":"Evening opening helps workers. They can visit after work. For example, a nurse finishing at six can arrive at seven.","version":1,"basic":true,"estimated_minutes":8,"open_prompt":"Practise develop a supported paragraph. Write two or three sentences about a useful local service, applying this lesson.","items":[{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-0","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["People who work during the day can then borrow books after work.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"People who work during the day can then borrow books after work.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A nurse finishing at six could visit at seven.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Public libraries should offer evening hours.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-1","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Separating bicycles from cars can make the journey safer."],"answer":"Separating bicycles from cars can make the journey safer.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A physical barrier keeps turning vehicles out of the cycle lane.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Cities should protect cycle lanes.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-2","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","An uninterrupted period helps students focus on a text.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"An uninterrupted period helps students focus on a text.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A class could read for fifteen minutes before discussing the story.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Schools should provide quiet reading time.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-3","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Shade gives visitors a place to rest during hot weather.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Shade gives visitors a place to rest during hot weather.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Older walkers could pause under a tree rather than leave early.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Parks need shaded seating.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-4","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Some workers can avoid the busiest commuting period."],"answer":"Some workers can avoid the busiest commuting period.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Starting at ten instead of nine may allow a less crowded train journey.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Employers should allow flexible start times.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-5","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Visitors need context to understand unfamiliar objects.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Visitors need context to understand unfamiliar objects.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A date and short description can explain how a tool was used.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Museums should label exhibits clearly.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-6","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Students often manage rent and food costs for the first time.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Students often manage rent and food costs for the first time.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A monthly spending exercise can reveal whether rent leaves enough for meals.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Universities should teach basic budgeting.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-7","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Returning containers can reduce disposable packaging."],"answer":"Returning containers can reduce disposable packaging.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A vegetable seller could refill the same crate each week.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Local markets should provide reusable crates.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-8","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Visitors can find services without asking for directions.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Visitors can find services without asking for directions.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A large reception sign helps a first-time visitor identify the right desk.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Public buildings need clear signs.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-9","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Experiments connect an abstract explanation to an observable result.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Experiments connect an abstract explanation to an observable result.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Watching ice melt lets pupils examine a change of state.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Schools should include practical science.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-10","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","An even surface makes short journeys more accessible."],"answer":"An even surface makes short journeys more accessible.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Repairing a broken pavement helps a person using a walking frame.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Towns should maintain walking paths.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-11","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Sharing reduces the need to buy rarely used items.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Sharing reduces the need to buy rarely used items.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Residents could borrow a projector for an occasional meeting.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Community centres should lend equipment.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-12","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Some tasks require sustained concentration.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Some tasks require sustained concentration.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: An analyst could check a report away from telephone conversations.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Offices should provide quiet rooms.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-13","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Simple recipes help students prepare meals independently."],"answer":"Simple recipes help students prepare meals independently.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A student who can cook rice and vegetables has an affordable dinner option.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Schools should teach cooking skills.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-14","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Knowing the expected wait helps passengers plan their journey.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Knowing the expected wait helps passengers plan their journey.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A passenger can decide whether there is time to buy water nearby.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Bus stops should display arrival times.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-15","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["New participants may need slower instruction before joining experienced players.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"New participants may need slower instruction before joining experienced players.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A first-time player can practise serving before playing a match.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Sports clubs should offer beginner sessions.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-16","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Preventing losses preserves treated water."],"answer":"Preventing losses preserves treated water.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Fixing a street leak keeps water in the supply network.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Councils should repair leaking pipes.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-17","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Readers can borrow without travelling to a branch.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Readers can borrow without travelling to a branch.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Someone recovering at home could download a novel.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Libraries should lend digital books.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-18","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Training reduces confusion when familiar procedures change.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Training reduces confusion when familiar procedures change.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A short demonstration can show staff where to save a shared document.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Workplaces should explain new software.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-19","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","Coordinated work can cover a larger area."],"answer":"Coordinated work can cover a larger area.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Small teams can clean separate streets on the same morning.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Neighbourhoods should organise litter collections.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-20","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Growing plants helps pupils observe how food develops.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Growing plants helps pupils observe how food develops.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Measuring a bean plant each week records its growth.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Schools should maintain vegetable gardens.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-21","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["Shelter makes waiting more comfortable in poor weather.","This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world."],"answer":"Shelter makes waiting more comfortable in poor weather.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: Passengers can stay dry during a rain shower.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Stations should provide covered waiting areas.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-22","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["This is an important issue and it is very important.","There are many different things in the world.","A reminder helps patients remember a booking made weeks earlier."],"answer":"A reminder helps patients remember a booking made weeks earlier.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: A message the previous day gives time to arrange transport.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Clinics should send appointment reminders.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_paragraph_support-23","kind":"choice","prompt":"Which sentence best develops this idea?","options":["There are many different things in the world.","Discussion lets learners compare explanations of difficult material.","This is an important issue and it is very important."],"answer":"Discussion lets learners compare explanations of difficult material.","explanation":"The reason explains the claim directly. A useful supporting example is: One student can explain a worked example while another checks the reasoning.","hint":"Compare every detail with the lesson strategy.","passage":"Universities should provide study groups.","stage":"independent"}]}'::jsonb,true) on conflict(skill,version) do nothing;
insert into skill_lab_private.lessons(skill,module,version,content,published) values ('writing_cohesion','writing',1,'{"skill":"writing_cohesion","module":"writing","title":"Connect ideas logically","outcome":"Order ideas so each sentence builds on the previous one.","trap":"Adding however does not create a real contrast.","strategy":"Introduce the claim before its explanation. Put an example after the reason it illustrates.","example":"Claim → reason → example. Use contrast language only when the next idea actually contrasts.","version":1,"basic":true,"estimated_minutes":8,"open_prompt":"Practise connect ideas logically. Write two or three sentences about a useful local service, applying this lesson.","items":[{"id":"writing_cohesion-0","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A nurse finishing at six could visit at seven.","Public libraries should offer evening hours.","People who work during the day can then borrow books after work."],"answer":["Public libraries should offer evening hours.","People who work during the day can then borrow books after work.","A nurse finishing at six could visit at seven."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-1","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A physical barrier keeps turning vehicles out of the cycle lane.","Cities should protect cycle lanes.","Separating bicycles from cars can make the journey safer."],"answer":["Cities should protect cycle lanes.","Separating bicycles from cars can make the journey safer.","A physical barrier keeps turning vehicles out of the cycle lane."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-2","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A class could read for fifteen minutes before discussing the story.","Schools should provide quiet reading time.","An uninterrupted period helps students focus on a text."],"answer":["Schools should provide quiet reading time.","An uninterrupted period helps students focus on a text.","A class could read for fifteen minutes before discussing the story."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-3","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["Older walkers could pause under a tree rather than leave early.","Parks need shaded seating.","Shade gives visitors a place to rest during hot weather."],"answer":["Parks need shaded seating.","Shade gives visitors a place to rest during hot weather.","Older walkers could pause under a tree rather than leave early."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"guided"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-4","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["Starting at ten instead of nine may allow a less crowded train journey.","Employers should allow flexible start times.","Some workers can avoid the busiest commuting period."],"answer":["Employers should allow flexible start times.","Some workers can avoid the busiest commuting period.","Starting at ten instead of nine may allow a less crowded train journey."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-5","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A date and short description can explain how a tool was used.","Museums should label exhibits clearly.","Visitors need context to understand unfamiliar objects."],"answer":["Museums should label exhibits clearly.","Visitors need context to understand unfamiliar objects.","A date and short description can explain how a tool was used."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-6","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A monthly spending exercise can reveal whether rent leaves enough for meals.","Universities should teach basic budgeting.","Students often manage rent and food costs for the first time."],"answer":["Universities should teach basic budgeting.","Students often manage rent and food costs for the first time.","A monthly spending exercise can reveal whether rent leaves enough for meals."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrating it.","stage":"independent"},{"id":"writing_cohesion-7","kind":"order","prompt":"Put the claim, reason and example in a logical order.","options":["A vegetable seller could refill the same crate each week.","Local markets should provide reusable crates.","Returning containers can reduce disposable packaging."],"answer":["Local markets should provide reusable crates.","Returning containers can reduce disposable packaging.","A vegetable seller could refill the same crate each week."],"explanation":"The claim introduces the subject. The reason explains it. The example illustrates that reason.","hint":"Introduce the idea before explaining or illustrati